            "review_title": "Review at Veranda Vietnamese",
            "review_text": "Dũng V\n1 contribution\n0\n10 points.\nMay 2026 • Solo\nI just had an incredible experience at the Veranda restaurant and really want to share it now!\nThe space here is very luxurious but still cosy, creating a comfortable feeling right from the entrance.\nThe food must be said to be excellent 👍 Every dish is presented beautifully, taste intense and very gentle. Fresh ingredients, crafty processing, eating is forever remembered. I was especially impressed with the service – friendly, enthusiastic and very professional staff.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 10, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
